---
permalink: /version.txt
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#-
  A plain-text stamp of what this domain is actually serving, so the whole
  deploy chain - merge, cron pull, build, rsync - can be checked from outside
  with one request:

    curl -s https://fianilchruinne.com/version.txt

  This is the only check that tests the chain end to end. A green cron job
  proves the script ran; it does not prove the files landed on this domain.

  version "dev" means the build did not come through a deploy path - a
  local build. Both deploy paths stamp it: scripts/deploy-lib.sh for the
  cPanel clones, and the GitHub Pages workflow for fianilchruinne.com
  (since 2026-10-06). Kept out of collections so it never reaches the
  sitemap, search index or any listing page.
-#}
version: {{ build.version }}
built: {{ build.builtAt }}
domain: {{ site.domain | default(site.url) }}
